 "chunks": [
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 0.12,
   "end": 2.552,
   "text": "Almost every fast food sign is red and yellow."
  },
  {
   "scene": 1,
   "start": 2.752,
   "end": 3.797,
   "text": "That's not an accident."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 4.197,
   "end": 6.608,
   "text": "Watch. Max is walking home. Not hungry. At all."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 6.808,
   "end": 10.627,
   "text": "Gray street. Gray buildings. Then, bam! A giant red and yellow sign."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 10.827,
   "end": 13.152,
   "text": "Red grabs your eye faster than almost any color."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 13.352,
   "end": 16.253,
   "text": "Yellow is one of the easiest colors to spot from far away."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 16.453,
   "end": 18.395,
   "text": "Together, they scream: stop here. Right now."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 18.595,
   "end": 20.856,
   "text": "And red is often linked with energy and appetite."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 21.056,
   "end": 22.421,
   "text": "Suddenly, Max is starving."
  },
  {
   "scene": 2,
   "start": 22.621,
   "end": 23.603,
   "text": "His feet just turn."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 24.003,
   "end": 26.52,
   "text": "Inside? Bright lights, bright colors, upbeat music."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 26.72,
   "end": 28.213,
   "text": "The whole room says: hurry up."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 28.413,
   "end": 31.507,
   "text": "Some studies found faster music can make people eat faster."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 31.707,
   "end": 34.181,
   "text": "Chomp, chomp, chomp. Burger gone in ninety seconds."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 34.381,
   "end": 35.747,
   "text": "And the seats? Hard plastic."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 35.947,
   "end": 38.144,
   "text": "Comfy enough to eat. Not comfy enough to stay."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 38.344,
   "end": 41.459,
   "text": "Because a table that empties fast is ready for the next customer."
  },
  {
   "scene": 3,
   "start": 41.659,
   "end": 44.325,
   "text": "Next customer. Next tray. Next order. All day long."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 44.725,
   "end": 48.117,
   "text": "Max walked in for nothing. He walked out with a combo and a milkshake."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 48.317,
   "end": 49.811,
   "text": "It's not magic. It's design."
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 50.011,
   "end": 53.467,
   "text": "So next time a red and yellow sign makes you hungry, ask yourself:"
  },
  {
   "scene": 4,
   "start": 53.667,
   "end": 55.032,
   "text": "Am I hungry? Or is the sign?"
  }
 ]
}